{"id":"5981","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5981_main_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为浅至中灰色、几乎布满天空一层高层云，大部分很厚，遮挡住太阳。它不是雨层云，因为浅灰色区域能够显露出太阳的位置，且雨层云无特征。该云层有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波型</span>，表明是波状云类。</p>\n<p>在南西南方向可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小雨</span>，而在东南方向可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雨幡或小雨</span>。从东南直至南西南的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴暗水平云带</span>是云中冰晶正在融化的融化层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，莫迪亚勒克VIC 3195","latitude":"纬度: 38° 0' 40'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 5' 3'' E","date":"04 July 2015 1507 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.2"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5981_syn_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>北边的副热带高压脊和南边的弱冷锋</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2015，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5981_upper_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>876 - 608 hPa为几乎饱和层 – 这个云顶可确认云不是卷层转化云，此外冷锋弱。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5981_sat_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>EUMETSAT红外4通道（10.3至11.3 μm）图像显示，卷层云尚未转化成高层云；它限于中层。在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚东北方向可看到弱冷锋。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2015","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/3706_main_altostratus-opacus-and-stratocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图像中显示的是靠近相机的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一块层积云</span> 和朝向地平线的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一片层积云</span> 。云块太小无法确定其透明度；云片似乎在半透明和蔽光之间的边缘，并被确定为蔽光云。层积云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">合并了几乎平行排列的元素</span> ；这是波状云类。层积云的底部位于900米处。通过层积云的间隙可以看到一层均匀的广阔灰色<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蔽光高层云</span> 。在地平线上是温暖锋前<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">大范围降水</span> 的前沿。雷达显示这条前沿位于30公里或更远的距离；也就是说，超出了地面的视觉范围。</p>\n<p>一小时后观测到降水线迹雨层云及连续降雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"16 April 2012 1952 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.5.2 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.5.2 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/3780_main_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio-and-cumulus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>蔽光高层云覆盖着天空，从中持续降下小到中雨。阴暗的云层是雨层云，但在拍照时无法识别，因为太阳没有被地平线上的云层完全掩盖。从通过云层传输的光量可以看出这一点：它足以照亮<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓云云种的最北端的积云顶部</span>。在这条被照亮的浓云线前面是一条<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云和中云线</span>；这条线在第一条的阴影下。含雨云的变薄标志着锋云带的后缘和积云正在这个云带后面的较冷空气中发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国美因茨","latitude":"纬度: 49° 58' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 8° 13' 56'' E","date":"25 September 2012 1112 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.6"}]}]}